WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,630
I want to tell you first to let it go.

2
00:00:03,110 --> 00:00:04,550
Our base is full of scientific researchers

3
00:00:04,910 --> 00:00:05,910
Only responsible for scientific research

4
00:00:06,150 --> 00:00:09,870
I will provide you with technical guidance for your actions and will not join the war.

5
00:00:10,270 --> 00:00:11,670
I know where the weapons cache is

6
00:00:11,670 --> 00:00:13,350
Allow us to join without participating in the war

7
00:00:13,830 --> 00:00:15,710
I'll tell you the location of the weapons depot

8
00:00:16,370 --> 00:00:19,890
You can join, but you won’t be able to contribute.

9
00:00:20,170 --> 00:00:21,730
Your base also can’t get supplies.

10
00:00:22,390 --> 00:00:23,470
What counts as contribution

11
00:00:23,590 --> 00:00:25,630
How many points does one weapons depot cost to a thousand points?

12
00:00:25,630 --> 00:00:28,030
If a major scientific research achievement is approved by me, it counts as something.

13
00:00:28,150 --> 00:00:29,150
Several points are used up

14
00:00:29,310 --> 00:00:34,240
Just didn’t contribute well

15
00:00:34,240 --> 00:00:43,660
I hope the base will please join three million

16
00:00:44,300 --> 00:00:46,140
Not far from 100 million
